Description: WhatsApp client for Maemo Leste, a port of Yappari
 Yappari was the WhatsApp client of the Nokia N900 (Maemo 5). This is its
 user interface ported to Qt 5 on Maemo Leste, with a new connection to
 WhatsApp: yappari-wa, a small daemon on whatsmeow that speaks today's
 multi-device protocol. Yappari is linked to an existing WhatsApp account as
 a linked device (pairing code or QR code), like WhatsApp Web.
 .
 Text messages, delivery and read receipts, typing indicators, group chats,
 pictures, voice notes and files, notifications, and message history kept
 on the phone. Messages arrive while the window is closed.
 .
 Yappari is not affiliated with WhatsApp or Meta.
XB-Maemo-Display-Name: Yappari
